
	Getters: return on no such elem?
		- Default/None
		- Throw Error

  	Variadic f(x1, x2, ...) vs f(xs)

	Arg order:
		- priority for -> 
		- priority for ->>, partial/flip
		- (f vrbl * params) — works with both -> and ->>
		- (partial oftypeQ int) — works good

	Composers:
		- only construct function?      f
		- construct and apply function? (f x)

